'''Garchomp''' (Japanese: '''ガブリアス''' ''Gaburias'') is a {{ct|Dragon}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

